3. SCENARIO CAPSULES (inside the Scenarios multiselect)
=====================================================================
- Keep p-multiSelect display="chip" and the existing "Add scenarios" placeholder.
- Capsule style: white background, 1px #DDE2E9 border, radius 999px,
